      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "少參事　三員"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "少参事 3員"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "[Shizuku] Junior councillor (shō-sanji): 3 persons. This column and the three to its left stand to the right of the ○宍戸藩 marker, so they close the entry that began on the facing half-leaf, whose last marker is ○志筑藩 and whose one column under it is 大參事　貳員. Two things confirm the attribution: the rank order runs on (senior councillors there, junior councillors here), and both leaves count men in 員 where Shishido, immediately to the left, counts them in 人."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "志筑少參事"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
