  {
    "id": "anno-lower_p241_left-03",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "一二三番大礮隊　三十六人〔礮隊長組込／一礮隊十二人ツヽ〕"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "一・二・三番大砲隊 36人〔砲隊長組込／一砲隊十二人ずつ〕"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "[Shizuku] Nos. 1, 2 and 3 heavy-gun batteries: 36 men. The qualifier is a warichu (double-column inline note) read right sub-column first: 礮隊長組込 — 'the battery commander counted in' — then 一礮隊十二人ツヽ — 'twelve men to each battery'. The arithmetic closes: three batteries at twelve men each is the 36 printed above."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "志筑大礮隊"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
